        "title": "The first table below shows changes in the total population of New York City from 1800 to 2000. The second and third tables show changes in the population of the five districts of the city (Manhattan, Brooklyn, Bronx, Queens, Staten Island) over the same ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu57dmz4Vo45wzxi01qlsW1Hghh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em><strong>The first table below shows changes in the total population of New York City from 1800 to 2000. The second and third tables show changes in the population of the five districts of the city (Manhattan, Brooklyn, Bronx, Queens, Staten Island) over the same period.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - New York City Population Changes: 1800&ndash;2000</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tzt3doaBcoa3vwxpE0olOAShgeb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i New York City Population Changes: 1800&ndash;2000 cho 3 charts, y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về:</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFxHdbVogo5x8Rx7sAKlIB1EgXd\"><strong>[Table 1]</strong> những thay đổi trong tổng d&acirc;n số của Th&agrave;nh phố New York từ năm 1800 đến 2000.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRKsdgw1YoRreDxbZiKluQakg0g\"><strong>[Table 2 + Table 3] </strong>những thay đổi trong d&acirc;n số của năm quận của th&agrave;nh phố (Manhattan, Brooklyn, Bronx, Queens, Staten Island) trong c&ugrave;ng khoảng thời gian <strong>--&gt; C&ugrave;ng bản chất n&ecirc;n m&igrave;nh sẽ xem như 1 table lu&ocirc;n bạn nh&eacute;!</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CISbdiN18obuXNx27k6lBL4Wgnh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> v&agrave;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"> <strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SR9ZdYWR1o7uhYxz4tklkj5Egmz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WESTd3x62oMFyTxQSCulbHCOg3d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề New York City Population Changes: 1800&ndash;2000 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: d&acirc;n số - th&agrave;nh phố New York - năm quận của th&agrave;nh phố - thay đổi từ 1800 đến 2000</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NYwkd1jG3ojREPxVYXKlUhzvgze\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KdivdwDedojusxxpiJbl0tdQgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng Mixed Charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RfeZd5x6co3gWJxmDKPl7ds8gyf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Th&agrave;nh phố New York đ&atilde; trải qua sự tăng trưởng d&acirc;n số đ&aacute;ng kể trong khoảng thời gian 200 năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkORdvLKJoCgC0xKQ5LlxPH3gcb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>d&acirc;n số của Manhattan đ&atilde; giảm đ&aacute;ng kể từ việc chiếm đa số &aacute;p đảo xuống c&ograve;n l&agrave; thiểu số nhỏ, trong khi c&aacute;c quận kh&aacute;c c&ugrave;ng nhau mở rộng để trở th&agrave;nh đa số lớn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch chia mỗi BODY tương ứng với 1 chart:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVPxdrYypohRjbxFqFTlbGXjgJf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ga3qdlo6woNbWrx3TralYPK4gWe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Table 1 - n&oacute;i về thay đổi của th&agrave;nh phố New York </strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IIF0dffnfozSGIxIRlqlaF4igQg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E5pYdsnSXoJyEjxmInil6YnagPc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1800 </strong><em>(bắt đầu ở mức khi&ecirc;m tốn l&agrave; 79,216)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XWkMdNSo0oXwNxxZKRilIN6zg2d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng thay đổi của d&acirc;n số th&agrave;nh phố New York v&agrave;o năm 1900 </strong><em>(d&acirc;n số tăng vọt l&ecirc;n 3,437,202 v&agrave;o năm 1900 - tăng 40 lần chỉ trong 1 thế kỷ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PHDtdochbo3DwaxSzarlevBug2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng thay đổi của d&acirc;n số th&agrave;nh phố New York v&agrave;o năm 2000 </strong><em>(tiếp tục tăng, với tổng số d&acirc;n đạt 8,009,185 - đ&aacute;nh dấu sự ph&aacute;t triển gấp 100 lần trong khoảng thời gian 200 năm)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BNxmdbwh6ooxrxxJhiIl92Cagsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RVtVdzmLwoJ5NXxtXuXlCHo7gSc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong>:<strong> Table 2 + Table 3 - n&oacute;i về thay đổi của c&aacute;c quận trong th&agrave;nh phố</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HR6WdbS5Doha0Rx1mU2lItB4gub\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup>, </strong>ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9b2dyeE7oAOpdxlPHAlAmaUgib\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1800 </strong><em>(Manhattan nổi bật nhất trong th&agrave;nh phố, chiếm tận 76%, so với chỉ 24% của bốn quận c&ograve;n lại cộng lại)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YenTdImgzo6LEvxpGz9l1pkkgKe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng thay đổi của d&acirc;n số th&agrave;nh phố New York v&agrave;o năm 2000 </strong><em>(tỷ lệ của Manhattan đ&atilde; giảm đ&aacute;ng kể xuống chỉ c&ograve;n 19% tổng d&acirc;n số, trong khi c&aacute;c quận kh&aacute;c đ&atilde; mở rộng tỷ lệ chung của họ l&ecirc;n 81%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeeTdsLFfomS2nxcCawlPKlogDb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XV3edT0DPosIxBx1CU0lNszFg6c\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>sự nổi bật v&agrave; &aacute;p đảo\"</strong>, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c cụm sau để đa dạng c&aacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eo89did7Iok2rtxBYTKlavBFgVC\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>dominance </strong>(n)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlvdtAi3ouJD0xnesTlhOLqgkd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>dominate STH</strong> (v)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AsEvdAs65oAWgFxusQOlIiTFglb\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BKqodKYCYoTvG7xPDJulYndxghv\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Manhattan's <strong>dominance</strong> significantly declined from being the overwhelming majority to a small minority.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MD9FdGooGo9KMExnLz8lv7FKgQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Manhattan <strong>dominated</strong> <strong>the city</strong> in 1800, accounting for 76% of the total population</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div 